# Manage Hardn Backups #########################################$
$
  [+] Backups              Enabled UFW installed, deny policy$
  [+] SSH Port             2230/tcp non-default$
$
# Backup Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Backup State         Enabled$
  [+] Backup Path          /var/backups/hardn Writable$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Backup State         Toggle backups of modified files$
   2) Backup Path          Change backup path$
   3) Verify Directory     Test if path is writable$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]:$

